`H3b` MEANS `test: in` 2026 `month` 6 `, a household of` (`test: an earner` "Avi" `, female:` FALSE `, born` (YMD 1985 4 1) `, paid` 15000) `, married:` (JUST (`test: married to` (`test: a housewife named` "Batya") `, the earner registered:` FALSE `, the earner claims a separate calculation:` TRUE)) `, with children` `H3 children` `, health` 626.0618

