`H4` MEANS `test: in` 2026 `month` 1 `, a household of` (`test: an earner` "Michal" `, female:` TRUE `, born` (YMD 1988 9 15) `, paid` 12000) `, married:` (JUST (`test: married to` (`test: a husband at home named` "Yoav") `, the earner registered:` FALSE `, the earner claims a separate calculation:` TRUE)) `, with children` `H4 children` `, health` 470.9618

