`H5 children` MEANS LIST `test: a child` "Tal" `, born` (YMD 2010 11 2), `test: a child` "Lior" `, born` (YMD 2013 12 25), `test: a child` "Maya" `, born` (YMD 2016 6 30), `test: a child` "Ido" `, born` (YMD 2020 2 14)
`H5` MEANS `test: in` 2026 `month` 4 `, a household of` (`test: an earner` "Avi" `, female:` FALSE `, born` (YMD 1985 4 1) `, paid` 12000) `, married:` (JUST (`test: married to` (`test: a housewife named` "Batya") `, the earner registered:` TRUE `, the earner claims a separate calculation:` TRUE)) `, with children` `H5 children` `, health` 470.9618

