§§ `The figures the composition reads`

-- The credit-point value: IL-03's s 120B for 2026 from IL-01's published 2025
-- figure; the same for 2025 (both frozen by s 120B(e)(1)); and twelve times the
-- booklet's monthly 242 (IL-01). 2024 and 2028 are IL-03's refusals.
#ASSERT `IL-07: the value of one credit point in tax year` 2026 EQUALS 2904
#ASSERT `IL-07: the value of one credit point in tax year` 2025 EQUALS `IL-01: the value of one credit point the Israel Tax Authority published for tax year 2025`
#ASSERT 12 TIMES `IL-01: the monthly credit-point figure in the withholding booklet for tax year` 2026 EQUALS `IL-07: the value of one credit point in tax year` 2026
#ASSERT REFUSED `IL-07: the value of one credit point in tax year` 2024 BECAUSE "section 120B as it stood before the 5785 amendment is not in the deposited text"
#ASSERT REFUSED `IL-07: the value of one credit point in tax year` 2028 BECAUSE "the rounding rules made under section 120B(d) are not encoded in this model"

-- The s 121B amount for 2026, and the two s 121 band tops the 5786 Law moved.
#ASSERT `IL-07: the amount in section 121B(a) the Israel Tax Authority published for tax year` 2026 EQUALS 721560
#ASSERT REFUSED `IL-07: the amount in section 121B(a) the Israel Tax Authority published for tax year` 2027 BECAUSE "IL-07 holds the s 121B(a) amount for tax year 2026 only"
#ASSERT `IL-03: the top of the reduced-rate 20% band in tax year` 2026 EQUALS 228000
#ASSERT `IL-03: the top of the reduced-rate 31% band in tax year` 2026 EQUALS 301200

-- The reduced collection threshold: IL-04 and IL-05 each carry the Institute's
-- 2026 figure (RECONCILE.md, clash N5); they agree.
#ASSERT `IL-04: the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2026 EQUALS 7703
#ASSERT `IL-04: the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2026 EQUALS `IL-05: the reduced collection threshold for 2026, as published`
#ASSERT `IL-05: the Schedule K item 1 maximum for a month of 2026` EQUALS 51910

-- Column D for 2026, summed over the six deduction branches: 1.04 and 4.67.
#ASSERT `IL-04: column D's combined percentage in the deduction branches, in a month of` 2026 `, on the upper part:` FALSE EQUALS 1.04
#ASSERT `IL-04: column D's combined percentage in the deduction branches, in a month of` 2026 `, on the upper part:` TRUE EQUALS 4.67

-- The child-allowance basic amounts on 1 January 2026.
#ASSERT `IL-06: the basic amount under paragraph (2)(a) in force on` (YMD 2026 1 1) EQUALS 173
#ASSERT `IL-06: the basic amount under paragraph (2)(b) in force on` (YMD 2026 1 1) EQUALS 219

§§ `Each row, through its adapter`

-- IL-01: 2 1/4 points for a resident man, 2 3/4 for a resident woman.
#ASSERT `IL-01: the credit points under sections 34, 36 and 36A for the earner` (`H1`'s `the earner`) EQUALS 2.25
#ASSERT `IL-01: the credit points under sections 34, 36 and 36A for the earner` (`H2`'s `the earner`) EQUALS 2.75
