#ASSERT REFUSED `IL-07: the net income of the household for the month, in` `H20` BECAUSE "the earner has a credit or deduction under the Income Tax Ordinance that IL-07 does not compute: it computes sections 35, 45A and 47 only from the further facts of its version 0.2.0, and no composed row encodes the others, such as section 39A, 44 or 46"
-- CHANGED BY THE SCHEDULE J RULING: 240.9012, as H1 (was 187.3811).
