§§ `Plumbing for the tests`

GIVEN h IS AN `IL-07 household in a month`
GIVETH AN `IL-07 couple`
`the couple of` h MEANS
    CONSIDER h's `the couple, if the earner has a spouse`
    WHEN JUST c  THEN c
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `test: the household has no couple`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`test: the household has no couple` MEANS
    REFUSE "test: the household has no couple"
